Third-party code in this folder
==============================

pico.js
  Pixel Intensity Comparison-based Object detection, JavaScript port, by Nenad Markus.
  Source:  https://github.com/nenadmarkus/picojs  (file pico.js, branch master)
  Licence: MIT ("This library is released under the MIT license", header of pico.js)
  sha256 of the original file: 785b981cc79e5fa3f7557dc3fa7773629d7529994d7627de41b77d8687649309
  Modified for MosaicPlan: ES module export instead of a global, one loop variable declared
  (listed in the header of pico.js).

facefinder.bin
  Frontal face detection cascade "facefinder" of pico, by Nenad Markus, unchanged.
  Source:  https://github.com/nenadmarkus/pico  (file rnt/cascades/facefinder, branch master;
           identical to commit c2e81f9d23cc11d1a612fd21e4f9de0921a5d0d9)
  Licence: MIT (LICENSE of the pico repository, reproduced below)
  sha256: d8014993e7298c7b1865d1f8b855d6dbf4ec5c808bf879e2091ab6837abf90cd

Not included: the pupil localiser "puploc" (its licence could not be confirmed).

